{"id":"msg_m_ex_vesti_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_vesti","label":"Vesti · Nikke"},"label":"3. Commander, are you busy?","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_vesti_02","next":"msg_m_ex_vesti_04","speakers":{"vesti":"Vesti"},"icons":{"vesti":"si_c091_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_1","text":"Commander, are you busy?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_2","text":"There's something","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_3","text":"I want to show you!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_4","text":"Then you can give me compliments...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_5","text":"Gah! Wait! Forget about that last part!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_6","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_6","text":"I'm listening.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_7","text":"Well,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_8","text":"I watched a horror movie by myself for the first time today.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_9","text":"I was super scared at first. However, I imagined that you were by my side,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_10","text":"then I wasn't so frightened.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_11","text":"It seems that I have made progress.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_12","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_12","text":"What was the movie about?","jump":"m_ex_vesti_03_14"},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_13","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_13","text":"You didn't close your eyes even once?","jump":"m_ex_vesti_03_19"},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_14","text":"Oh... um...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_15","text":"To be honest, I don't remember much about it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_16","text":"There were so many terrifying moments,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_17","text":"and I kept closing my eyes,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_18","text":"so I didn't quite get it.","jump":"m_ex_vesti_03_23"},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_19","text":"To be honest,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_20","text":"I did have my eyes closed a lot... T^T","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_21","text":"I tried my best to keep them open,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_22","text":"but I just couldn't help it...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_23","text":"That doesn't really count as watching a horror movie.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_24","text":"I guess it's nothing","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_25","text":"to be proud of then TT^TT","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_26","text":"But it's nice that you're willing to try.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_27","text":"You think so?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_28","text":"It's brave of you to face your fears.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_29","text":"Really？","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_30","text":"You think so?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_31","text":"You really think I did a good job?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_32","text":"You definitely did.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_33","text":"Wow, I didn't expect a compliment like that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_34","text":"You really made my day.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_35","text":"Why don't we watch a horror movie together next time?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_36","text":"!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_37","text":"You're not serious, are you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_38","text":"Of course, I am.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_39","text":"All right, it's official. The only way I'll ever watch a horror movie again","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_40","text":"is if I'm watching one together with you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_41","text":":D","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_42","text":"What time is good for you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_43","text":"How about tomorrow??","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_44","text":"Huh?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_45","text":"So soon?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_46","text":"Is that okay?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_47","text":"Of course.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_48","text":"I can come to your room at say... tomorrow noon?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_49","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_49","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_50","text":"All right!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_51","text":"Tomorrow can't come soon enough! >////<","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_03_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_03_52","text":"See you tomorrow, Commander.","jump":null}],"chat":true}